## What is in it

One LoRA adapter for each trained method, at the checkpoint the checkpoint choice picked: the highest
twin confirmed accuracy on dev among the checkpoints its run saved. Each package holds the adapter, its
model card and the license; the base model is fetched by its own id, under its own license, which the
model card names. Every package's sha256 was committed before the tag, and the release workflow refused
any package whose bytes differed.

{{ table("release.assets") }}

